{"seq":2,"slug":"wind-energy","title":"风能技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onshore-wind-systems","title":"陆上风电系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/onshore-wind-systems","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"offshore-floating-wind","title":"海上与漂浮式风电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/offshore-floating-wind","wordCount":1853,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"wind-turbine-technology","title":"风机核心技术演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/wind-turbine-technology","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"风能技术\">风能技术</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>风能是全球第二大可再生电力来源。本章覆盖陆上风电的技术成熟与规模化经验、海上风电（含漂浮式）的深远海拓展，以及风机本体技术的核心演进方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>陆上风电系统</td>\n<td>大型化趋势、变桨变速控制、选址与并网、全球装机格局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>海上与漂浮式风电</td>\n<td>固定式基础类型、漂浮式平台（Spar/TLP/半潜）、深远海开发进展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>风机核心技术演进</td>\n<td>直驱vs齿轮箱、超导发电机、碳纤维叶片、数字孪生运维</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>容量因子（Capacity Factor）</strong>：实际发电量与理论最大发电量之比</li>\n<li><strong>漂浮式风电（Floating Offshore Wind）</strong>：适用于水深&gt;60m海域的风电部署方案</li>\n<li><strong>直驱永磁（DDPM）</strong>：去除齿轮箱的传动方案，降低故障率</li>\n</ul>\n"}